WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.367
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:03.834
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.834 --> 00:00:06.133
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:09.100
President Biden hosted
a state dinner tonight

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.434
for Australian prime minister
Anthony Albanese,

00:00:12.434 --> 00:00:15.000
and the menu included
butternut squash soup

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.367
and roasted beet salad,

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:19.100
which is weird because
I was under the impression

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.200
that Australia was our ally.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.167
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:26.901
[ Australian accent ]
Beet salad?

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:28.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:32.801
[ Normal voice ] The House
of Representatives voted today

00:00:32.801 --> 00:00:35.234
to elect Louisiana congressman
Mike Johnson

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:36.567
Speaker of the House,

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:40.100
and apparently this
election result he will accept.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:42.767
That's right, Republicans today

00:00:42.767 --> 00:00:44.534
elected Mike Johnson
Speaker of the House.

00:00:44.534 --> 00:00:47.467
Wow, the speaker race
was so embarrassing,

00:00:47.467 --> 00:00:51.334
they're not even giving
their real names anymore.

00:00:51.334 --> 00:00:53.100
Mike Johnson is the name
you give

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.000
when you check in to a motel
with your mistress.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.167
That's what Spirit Halloween

00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:01.801
calls their
Michael Jackson costume.

00:01:01.801 --> 00:01:03.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.434 --> 00:01:07.934
During the second secret ballot

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:10.167
in last night's closed-door
Republican conference meeting,

00:01:10.167 --> 00:01:11.734
former House Speaker
Kevin McCarthy

00:01:11.734 --> 00:01:14.234
reportedly received
33 of the 34 votes

00:01:14.234 --> 00:01:17.100
cast against Speaker designate
Mike Johnson.

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:20.267
Got to admit, it would have been
pretty funny if, after all this,

00:01:20.267 --> 00:01:22.968
Republicans had landed
back on McCarthy.

00:01:22.968 --> 00:01:25.601
Would be like matching
with your ex-wife on Tinder.

00:01:25.601 --> 00:01:28.601
"What? We have a lot in common.

00:01:28.601 --> 00:01:31.968
Our children, for example."

00:01:31.968 --> 00:01:34.367
Trump 2020 campaign lawyer
Jenna Ellis

00:01:34.367 --> 00:01:35.767
pleaded guilty yesterday

00:01:35.767 --> 00:01:38.334
to a criminal charge
in the Georgia election case

00:01:38.334 --> 00:01:40.901
and cried while expressing
regret for her actions.

00:01:40.901 --> 00:01:44.133
Wow, pretty stark contrast
from her mug shot.

00:01:44.133 --> 00:01:46.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.901 --> 00:01:49.467
This photo looks like
she also needed one

00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:50.701
for her Christmas card

00:01:50.701 --> 00:01:53.133
and didn't want
to make two stops.

00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:54.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.934 --> 00:01:56.367
In his testimony yesterday

00:01:56.367 --> 00:01:58.300
at former president Trump's
civil fraud trial,

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:01.267
ex-lawyer Michael Cohen said
whatever issues Trump had,

00:02:01.267 --> 00:02:04.534
he "would bring it to me
in order to resolve,"

00:02:04.534 --> 00:02:07.734
which explains why Cohen
always carried a plunger.

00:02:07.734 --> 00:02:10.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.067 --> 00:02:11.400
Yeah, that's funny.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:13.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.734 --> 00:02:16.067
A pest-control company
has unveiled its annual list

00:02:16.067 --> 00:02:21.400
of the rattiest cities,
and New York City ranks third.

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:25.434
We came in third?
Who got -- Who got first place?

00:02:25.434 --> 00:02:27.634
16th-century London?

00:02:27.634 --> 00:02:30.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.667 --> 00:02:33.934
A new study suggests that the
moon is 40 million years older

00:02:33.934 --> 00:02:35.601
than scientists
previously believed.

00:02:35.601 --> 00:02:38.734
Even crazier, John Stamos is 60.

00:02:38.734 --> 00:02:40.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.534 --> 00:02:43.734
According to a new survey,

00:02:43.734 --> 00:02:45.868
nearly 1 in 4 adults
feel lonely,

00:02:45.868 --> 00:02:48.167
and more often than not,
it's the drummer.

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:50.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.801 --> 00:02:58.467
Traffic on a highway in England
recently came to a stop

00:02:58.467 --> 00:03:01.400
after an escaped pack of llamas
and alpacas

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:02.701
wandered onto the road.

00:03:02.701 --> 00:03:04.133
Said frustrated drivers,

00:03:04.133 --> 00:03:06.234
"Which ones are which?"

00:03:06.234 --> 00:03:08.000
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.834 --> 00:03:12.667
And finally,
according to a new book,

00:03:12.667 --> 00:03:15.467
McDonald's once tried to buy
the chain Panera Bread.

00:03:15.467 --> 00:03:19.033
Wow, she spilled the tea
about everyone in that memoir.

00:03:19.033 --> 00:03:20.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.868 --> 00:03:28.501
I told you that Panera thing
in confidence.

00:03:28.501 --> 00:03:29.734
That was the monologue,
everybody.

00:03:29.734 --> 00:03:30.634
We're off and running.

